   "videoCue": "Transition",
   "klara": "And the boy forgot his father. Yet, as an unfortunate side effect, he also forgot his own name. As the boy's sentences, which unfailingly began with \"I\", started to lose sight of what that \"I\" stood for, his tongue started to lose its strength and loll about in his mouth like a wet tennis ball on the deck of a yacht, which made him cough.",
